        "type": "game",
        "name": "Zerun: The Tiny Planet",
        "steam_appid": 3801360,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Zerun?</strong><br>A shamanic initiation. A vision quest through a labyrinth of danger and meaning. You are not truly here — yet what happens here shapes the world you left behind. Walk the path of the shaman. Solve ancient puzzles, survive the trials, and gather what’s needed to heal your world. Earn every artifact, complete every rite, and bring your world back to life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to walk the path.</strong> Explorer Mode: no timer, no fail state. Play at your own pace and enjoy the journey. Or test your instincts in Time Challenge Mode, where every second counts and the pressure never sleeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two soundtracks, one world.</strong> Choose between two distinct audio styles: a dynamic soundtrack — fast, rhythmic, and designed to push you toward better times and higher leaderboard ranks — or an atmospheric soundtrack that surrounds you in sacred stillness and dreamlike calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world seen through ritual eyes.</strong><br>Your view is curved and dreamlike, a spiritual tunnel guiding your senses. What you see may deceive — but every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze is alive.</strong> <br>Run. React. Adapt. Paths shift. Traps awaken. Sacred items must be earned — nothing is given for free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you complete the rite?</strong><br>Master the trials. Gather the green artifacts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heal the world. Become the shaman you were meant to be.</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Zerun?</strong><br>A shamanic initiation. A vision quest through a labyrinth of danger and meaning. You are not truly here — yet what happens here shapes the world you left behind. Walk the path of the shaman. Solve ancient puzzles, survive the trials, and gather what’s needed to heal your world. Earn every artifact, complete every rite, and bring your world back to life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two ways to walk the path.</strong> Explorer Mode: no timer, no fail state. Play at your own pace and enjoy the journey. Or test your instincts in Time Challenge Mode, where every second counts and the pressure never sleeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two soundtracks, one world.</strong> Choose between two distinct audio styles: a dynamic soundtrack — fast, rhythmic, and designed to push you toward better times and higher leaderboard ranks — or an atmospheric soundtrack that surrounds you in sacred stillness and dreamlike calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world seen through ritual eyes.</strong><br>Your view is curved and dreamlike, a spiritual tunnel guiding your senses. What you see may deceive — but every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze is alive.</strong> <br>Run. React. Adapt. Paths shift. Traps awaken. Sacred items must be earned — nothing is given for free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you complete the rite?</strong><br>Master the trials. Gather the green artifacts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heal the world. Become the shaman you were meant to be.</h2>",
        "short_description": "A tiny-planet puzzle platformer with a curved world – explore, collect, and solve levels that wrap around themselves. Step onto a tiny planet and watch the world curve around you. Every level bends, every path leads back – can you find them all?",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
